window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Captor and captive. Lovers. Soul mates. </b></p> <p>We're all that and more. </p> <p>We thought we were past the worst of it. We thought we finally had a chance. </p> <p>We thought wrong. </p> <p>We're Nora and Julian, and this is our story. </p> <p><i><b>Hold Me</b></i><b> is the conclusion of the Twist Me trilogy, told from Nora and Julian's point of view.</b> </p>"; 
